the block-level association Σ_b Cov(G − y_b, d_b²)/block-genic² is negative under the move in both
(the sign-symmetric association of validate/genic_decline.md, at block resolution). The kernel's
per-locus genic ratio is printed for reference; the model has no per-locus genic variance.

